    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream Place: A peaceful cooperative exploration game</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Dream Place</i>, an indie game where you can explore serene and mysterious environments, collect items, customize your space, and uncover the hidden secrets of a captivating world. Whether playing solo or with friends (up to 5 players), this is a journey shaped by you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Game Modes for Unique Adventures</strong></h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream Mode \u2013 Explore at Your Own Pace, Build Your Sanctuary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Dream Mode</strong>, relaxation is the key. Wander through calming landscapes and quiet spaces where the only goal is exploration and creation. Collect items, design your perfect refuge, and immerse yourself in a world with no pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Mode \u2013 Face Challenges and Push Your Limits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those seeking a more intense adventure, <strong>Survival Mode</strong> adds a thrilling twist. Manage your health, hunger, and energy while navigating a world that is as beautiful as it is dangerous. Gather resources, face obstacles, and adapt to a dynamic environment that will test your survival skills.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream Place: A peaceful cooperative exploration game</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Dream Place</i>, an indie game where you can explore serene and mysterious environments, collect items, customize your space, and uncover the hidden secrets of a captivating world. Whether playing solo or with friends (up to 5 players), this is a journey shaped by you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Game Modes for Unique Adventures</strong></h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream Mode \u2013 Explore at Your Own Pace, Build Your Sanctuary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Dream Mode</strong>, relaxation is the key. Wander through calming landscapes and quiet spaces where the only goal is exploration and creation. Collect items, design your perfect refuge, and immerse yourself in a world with no pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Mode \u2013 Face Challenges and Push Your Limits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those seeking a more intense adventure, <strong>Survival Mode</strong> adds a thrilling twist. Manage your health, hunger, and energy while navigating a world that is as beautiful as it is dangerous. Gather resources, face obstacles, and adapt to a dynamic environment that will test your survival skills.</p>",
    "short_description": "Dream Place is a peaceful co-op exploration game for 1 to 5 players. Collect items, customize your space, and complete tasks to uncover the secrets of this world.",
